          "short": "$y=3\\pm\\sqrt{6}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y^2-6y&=-3\\\\y^2-6y+9&=-3+9\\\\(y-3)^2&=6\\\\y-3&=\\pm\\sqrt{6}\\\\y&=3\\pm\\sqrt{6}\\end{align*}$$",
